[E]Haa tuz bin phagun me phaag [B]nahi re,        [E]Haa tujh bin jaage bhi jaag [B]nahi re
[A]Tere bina.. o mahiya,        [A]Din dariya [B]rain jazire lag [E]de ne
[E]Adhoori adhoori adhoori kahaani,        [B]adhoora alvida
